%% Sequence Diagram: Youth Account Management - API Flows
sequenceDiagram
  participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
  participant UI as Parent UI (React)
  participant API as Youth Account API (Node.js)
  participant GW as API Gateway
  participant ACC as Account Service
  participant PAY as Payment Service
  participant LEDGER as Transaction Ledger Service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL DB
  Note over Parent,UI: Parent uses web app to manage youth accounts

  Parent->>UI: Login (OAuth)
  UI->>GW: Authenticated API call (/dashboard)
  GW->>API: Forward request (validate RBAC)
  API->>DB: Get account settings/limits
  API->>ACC: Get account details
  API->>LEDGER: Get recent transactions
  API-->>GW: Dashboard data
  GW-->>UI: Dashboard data
  UI-->>Parent: Show dashboard
  Note over API: All actions logged for audit (GDPR/PCI/ISO)

  Parent->>UI: Initiate fund transfer
  UI->>GW: POST /fund-transfer
  GW->>API: Forward request (validate RBAC)
  API->>PAY: Transfer funds
  API->>DB: Update balance
  API-->>GW: Transfer result
  GW-->>UI: Transfer result
  UI-->>Parent: Show transfer status
  Note over API: Audit log, compliance enforced

  Parent->>UI: Set spending limit
  UI->>GW: PUT /spending-limit
  GW->>API: Forward request (validate RBAC)
  API->>DB: Update limit
  API-->>GW: Limit update result
  GW-->>UI: Limit update result
  UI-->>Parent: Show update confirmation

  Parent->>UI: View transactions
  UI->>GW: GET /transactions
  GW->>API: Forward request (validate RBAC)
  API->>LEDGER: Fetch transaction history
  API-->>GW: Transaction history
  GW-->>UI: Transaction history
  UI-->>Parent: Show transactions
